<<<
fascist &c. The Italian words— fascista pl. -ti, fascismo—are pronounced (roughly) fahshé’stah -te, -é’sm6.
===
**fascist &c.** The Italian words—*fascista* pl. -ti, *fascismo*—are pronounced (roughly) fahshē'stah -tē, -ē'smō.
>>>

<<<
In English they should be fashi’sta,-té, -i’zm, or else anglicized to fascist pl. -s, -ism, pronounced fa’si-.
===
In English they should be fashi'*sta*,-tē,-ĭ'zmō, or else anglicized to *fascist* pl. -s, -ism, pronounced fă'sĭ-.
>>>

